,"translations":[{"language":"en-US","title":"Nurse Witch Komugi R","overview":"Komugi Yoshida is an energetic but clumsy middle-school student who performs as an idol. Although her popularity is lacking, Komugi lives a dual life between her two worlds, until a mysterious creature named Usa-P appears before Komugi and grants her the powers of a Legendary Girl. Now Komugi has reluctantly become Magical Nurse, and must add a third life of fighting monsters to her already crowded lifestyle."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"2002年～2005年にかけてタツノコプロ制作でOVAの展開を行った「ナースウィッチ小麦ちゃんマジカルて」、「ナースウィッチ小麦ちゃんマジカルて Z」がTVシリーズとして新たに生まれ変わります。前作をベースにしながら、キャラクターや設定を一新し、学生、アイドル、魔法少女という三足のわらじを履いて奮闘する小麦ちゃんとそのライバル達のドタバタな日常を描いていきます。可愛いキャラクターたちはもちろん、笑いアリ・涙アリ（？）のストーリーや、タツノコプロが誇る３DCGによるライブシーン等、見どころ満載でお届けします。","tagline":"まじかるナース、元気に参上！ みんな一緒に～レッツ！ コムギケーション！"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aZkvCxEPbg9GLJBPDff6QgmlVjw.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aZkvCxEPbg9GLJBPDff6QgmlVjw.png","language":"en","width":584,"height":293},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j851FznXqfhXYQpEVCFE05AhpXD.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j851FznXqfhXYQpEVCFE05AhpXD.png","language":"ja","width":546,"height":290}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tYicZFvSRqL5dbik9lJVAX9bL99.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tYicZFvSRqL5dbik9lJVAX9bL99.jpg","language":"en","width":640,"height":960},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e3AhVLqHKX4YpmInEZtPAP3lUqI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e3AhVLqHKX4YpmInEZtPAP3lUqI.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/FKDXcEwfAnKPtDvFy69JZpmuDd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/FKDXcEwfAnKPtDvFy69JZpmuDd.jpg","language":"ja","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n9ZR2MI